            {
              "type": "bullets",
              "items": [
                "`export const f = 1` pairs with `import { f } from './m.js'`: ==exact name== in braces",
                "Default: `import any from './m.js'`, any name; ==one default== per module",
                "Imports are ==live read-only bindings==, not copies",
                "Modules run ==once==, are cached, and are **strict mode**"
